\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Itemize
Two different goals: (i) Historical / EOD and (ii) Online (our focus)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Get a better estimate of intraday changes in 
\begin_inset Formula $\theta=\left\{ \eta,\sigma,\mu\right\} $
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Captures intraday change in relative tick size (as the price of the asset
 changes)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
No need for a rolling window to estimate η and σ: react quickly to changes
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Easy to calculate (trades: price changes only)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Efficient prices estimates (σ and μ) can be combined across different contracts
 / assets with the same underlying 
\end_layout

\end_deeper
