\begin_layout Itemize
From 
\begin_inset Formula $\rho_{+}^{C}-\rho_{-}^{C}=2\cdot\eta\cdot\tanh\left(\frac{\mu}{\sigma^{2}}\cdot\frac{\alpha}{S_{0}}\right)$
\end_inset

 we infer 
\begin_inset Formula $\hat{\mu}=\frac{\hat{\sigma}^{2}}{\left(\frac{\alpha}{S_{0}}\right)}\cdot\tanh^{-1}\left(\frac{\rho_{+}^{C}-\rho_{-}^{C}}{2\cdot\hat{\eta}}\right)$
\end_inset


\end_layout

